==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] will easily clear this stage.


